    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just got hired to guard the button that destroys the Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you better take your task seriously. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your job now. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just whatever you do, you are not supposed to press the button, otherwise the world goes poof. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no idea how many things can distract you while doing this task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and did I mention there are literally no breaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you decide to quit, that also destroys the Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just guard the button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the sake of the World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different events to react to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeing the timer go up</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other guards through an Online Leaderboard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will test your patience, how long can you guard the button?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just got hired to guard the button that destroys the Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you better take your task seriously. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your job now. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just whatever you do, you are not supposed to press the button, otherwise the world goes poof. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no idea how many things can distract you while doing this task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and did I mention there are literally no breaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you decide to quit, that also destroys the Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just guard the button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the sake of the World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different events to react to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeing the timer go up</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other guards through an Online Leaderboard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will test your patience, how long can you guard the button?</p>",
